stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ActivePack: Spawn on eligible host / apply production restrictions
    ActivePack --> Inspecting: Owner inspects Alpha
    Inspecting --> ActivePack: Observe or close
    Inspecting --> AttemptRunning: Tame / start time limit and resonance meter
    AttemptRunning --> ActivePack: Timeout or cancellation / no reward
    AttemptRunning --> Resolved: Success / grant one card and clear restrictions
    Resolved --> Resolved: Duplicate completion / no second reward
    note right of ActivePack
      Visitor inspection must not transition
      into an attempt or reward claim.
    end note
